# Issue #64: the last seven masked gadgets (Bo's totem, Max's rewind, Frank's pull, Griff's bomb, Leon's smoke, Damian's
# microphone, Starr Nova's fly area) work and leave g_masked. A diff on top of the other patches (after
# star_powers2.patch). Paths relative to engine/. gadget.c: SHOT projectiles carry their skill's summon / item (arm_shot:
# 0xb703c8 / 0xb79130, as libg's attack path arms them), UseWeaponAmmo costs and needs one ammo bar (shot_ready), the
# REWIND kind (Max: the bolt, whose end spawns SpeedyRewindArea; the host's rewind at the area's end or at a second fire,
# GadImpl.again; no cooldown while it is pending); superfix_moves.c: superfix_valid_spot / superfix_teleport;
# superfix_status.c: a store status with Levitation from an area sets libg's levitating byte (+0x9b0), summon areas with a
# Refreshable ally status re-apply every tick, Bo's ExtraSuperCharge area adds +CustomValue % charge per hit while inside
# (ZN_TOTEM); superfix_items.c: pick-up heal items (type 72, Damian's microphone) give their StatusEffectAlly to the
# picker; superfix.c / env.c: the summon-area table is emptied at a new battle (an old entry with a recycled character id
# kept a new summon from getting its area).
